{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IoK1f5b5Xp1793158633.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人郭思治表示，港股短期走勢仍然不明朗，即使收復10天線，但只要有少許不明因素出來，又會再進一步向下行。</p><p></p><p>意博資本董事總經理郭思治表示︰「如果恒生指數在這一刻能夠喘定在23,000點，再回升至十天線守穩，表示初步是脫險。但這個情況不代表大市不再反覆，一旦有少少不明因素出來，大市又會再進一步向下行。大市有比較明快的方向感，如何都要到11月上旬才會見到。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:41:58.906440+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:23.367957+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:38:22.047972+00:00","content_hash":"5bb01492b85e5d461783a0a98350d8bb70098736d02baeebb9439a17199b9f2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}